<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11637" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cristātus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		crista, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that has a tuft</i> or <i>crest,
				tufted, crested</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ales,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					1, 455</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cristati oris ales,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					M. 11, 597</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aves, i. e. galli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					14, 223</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">draco,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					4, 599</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 13, 13, §
			35</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>crested,
			plumed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cassis pennis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					8, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">galeae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					9, 40, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jubar,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 3, 223</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Achilles,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 468</span></i>
			.</div>
